---
// Go Heap vs Linux RSS vs MADV_DONTNEED scavenger timeline in Kubernetes pods.
const W = 900;
const H = 276;
---
<figure class="ghlrm">
  <div class="ghlrm-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Timeline comparing Go HeapInuse dropping after GC versus Linux RSS remaining elevated temporarily until Go's scavenger executes MADV_DONTNEED under cgroup working_set accounting.">
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="872" height="248" rx="10" class="ghlrm-card" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="ghlrm-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Why Linux container RSS looks higher than Go HeapAlloc (madvise MADV_DONTNEED)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Vì sao chỉ số RSS trong container Linux cao hơn Go HeapAlloc (madvise MADV_DONTNEED)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="62" width="194" height="126" rx="8" class="ghlrm-box" />
      <text x="127" y="85" text-anchor="middle" class="ghlrm-b">t=1s: Peak Traffic</text>
      <text x="44" y="109" class="ghlrm-m">Go HeapAlloc: 420 MiB</text>
      <text x="44" y="129" class="ghlrm-m">Go HeapSys: 480 MiB</text>
      <text x="44" y="149" class="ghlrm-b-red">Linux RSS: 485 MiB</text>
      <text x="44" y="170" class="ghlrm-m">All 4KiB pages dirtied</text>

      <line x1="224" y1="125" x2="256" y2="125" class="ghlrm-edge" />

      <rect x="256" y="62" width="204" height="126" rx="8" class="ghlrm-box" />
      <text x="358" y="85" text-anchor="middle" class="ghlrm-b">t=2s: GC Finishes Sweep</text>
      <text x="270" y="109" class="ghlrm-b-ok">Go HeapAlloc: 90 MiB!</text>
      <text x="270" y="129" class="ghlrm-m">Free spans held in mheap</text>
      <text x="270" y="149" class="ghlrm-b-red">Linux RSS: STILL ~480 MiB</text>
      <text x="270" y="170" class="ghlrm-m">Kept ready for reuse spike</text>

      <line x1="460" y1="125" x2="492" y2="125" class="ghlrm-edge" />

      <rect x="492" y="62" width="378" height="126" rx="8" class="ghlrm-box is-ok" />
      <text x="681" y="85" text-anchor="middle" class="ghlrm-b-ok">t=3s+: Scavenger calls MADV_DONTNEED</text>
      <text x="506" y="109" class="ghlrm-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Go 1.16+ Linux uses MADV_DONTNEED (drops RSS fast).</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Từ Go 1.16 Linux dùng MADV_DONTNEED (hạ RSS ngay).</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="506" y="129" class="ghlrm-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. HeapSys stays ~480 MiB virtual; RSS returns to ~110 MiB.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. HeapSys giữ dải ảo, nhưng RSS vật lý tụt về ~110 MiB.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="506" y="149" class="ghlrm-b-ok">
        <tspan data-lang-en>3. Note: K8s working_set counts page cache alongside RSS!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>3. K8s working_set cộng cả OS file cache nên dễ báo OOM ảo!</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="202" width="840" height="44" rx="6" class="ghlrm-box" />
      <text x="44" y="229" class="ghlrm-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Debug order: check runtime.MemStats.HeapInuse first -&gt; inspect pprof inuse_space -&gt; watch container anon_rss (exclude clean page cache).</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chẩn đoán chuẩn: soi HeapInuse -&gt; mở pprof inuse_space -&gt; xem anon_rss thật thay vì nhìn metric tổng.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>After Go sweeps unused objects, freed 4 KiB pages remain mapped in process RSS temporarily until the background scavenger calls MADV_DONTNEED (or GOMEMLIMIT pace accelerates return).</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Sau khi GC quét sạch rác, các trang 4 KiB trống tạm thời vẫn giữ trong bảng RSS cho tới khi scavenger ngầm gọi MADV_DONTNEED trả khung RAM về nhân Linux (hoặc khi đặt GOMEMLIMIT ép trả nhanh hơn).</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ghlrm { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .ghlrm-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .ghlrm svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 680px; height: auto; }
  .ghlrm text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .ghlrm-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .ghlrm-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .ghlrm-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ghlrm-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ghlrm-edge { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .ghlrm-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ghlrm-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ghlrm-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .ghlrm-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ghlrm-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ghlrm-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .ghlrm figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
